layout: base.njk
seoTitle: "Charter Fishing Tampa Bay | Local Fishing Guides"
description: "Private fishing charters in Tampa Bay with a team of local guides. Inshore, nearshore, offshore & crappie trips from $550. Call (813) 714-5670 to book."
heroImg: grouper-tampa-bay
homeHero: true
